# Data: raw downloads are reproducible via data/fetch-raw.ps1 + atlas-etl and
# stay gitignored; data/compiled/ is the app's actual runtime data and IS
# committed (see README.md's "Data" section and LICENSES.md) so a fresh
# clone runs with zero downloads.
data/raw/*
!data/raw/README.md

